WEBVTT

00:05:27.323 --> 00:05:30.618
427 mammals.

00:05:30.659 --> 00:05:35.206
One in ten of the world’s bird species
live in the Amazon,

00:05:35.247 --> 00:05:39.627
which has been inhabited by Indigenous
people for thousands of years.

00:05:40.378 --> 00:05:44.382
Now, try to imagine,

00:05:44.382 --> 00:05:48.094
when non-Indigenous people
come to my community

00:05:48.094 --> 00:05:54.392
to try to teach us about sustainable
forest management or conservation.

00:05:54.433 --> 00:05:56.018
(Laughter)

00:05:57.436 --> 00:06:01.482
We are the forests,
we breathe the forests.